  {
   "key": "entity.the_deep_void.undertaker.driftingmonoliths3",
   "id": "driftingmonoliths3",
   "en": "The weavers and their craft: somethin' truly marvelous! Ye should've seen it for yeself. I've only seen it once as a young lad. I've never forgotten that moment ever since.",
   "zh": "",
   "loot_table": "",
   "projectile": false
  },
  {
   "key": "entity.the_deep_void.undertaker.gaol2",
   "id": "gaol2",
   "en": "There's a huge prison around here; they call it the \"pit\". Apparently, the sage of wrath is emprisoned there. She was sent there after assaultin' another sage. I don't really know the details though.",
   "zh": "",
   "loot_table": "",
   "projectile": false
  },
  {
   "key": "entity.the_deep_void.undertaker.graveyard4",
   "id": "graveyard4",
   "en": "This brings back bad memories of me brother. Oh how I miss him! I'm sure he his happy wherever he is now. He died at the hands of those bastards from the capital. I was the one to bury him. May he rest in peace.",
   "zh": "",
   "loot_table": "",
   "projectile": false
  },
  {
   "key": "entity.the_deep_void.undertaker.hurt8",
   "id": "hurt8",
